    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Well, listen, two of the four things I just mentioned. I want to talk to you about today. First of all, the sanctity of life, and then secondly, education, because I know you have some legislation that you're putting forward as well. First, the sanctity of life. Dobbs, the end of Roe v. Wade. Why is this vital to our nation going forward?",
