  {
    "episode_id": 72585,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72585.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "You're so right. And I think women know that the devastation that occurs after an abortion. Many people know women who made that choice. And like you pointed out, many times they are coerced to doing it by a boyfriend. They think they have no choice. They're not aware of the crisis pregnancy center or the pregnancy help center in the area. And they regret it. their whole life. And studies have shown that women who have had abortions, and it could be as high as one in four women have had one, but they have increased depression, mental health, anxiety, problems, the rest of their life, guilt. And of course, those things can be overcome through the power of Jesus Christ. and what many women have received that healing from it. But they are in some ways victims of this abortion industry as well that just made a lot of money off of them. And now they're going to be hopefully supported and be able to bring that baby to term if they have an unplanned pregnancy. And I've talked to several men though as well who have grieved their whole life.",
