    "turn_text": "And let me jump in too and just say, when you talk about these things, there is a moral framework to good education. So there is a battle there. And that's actually where this battle is at. There's a secularization coming into our schools, a racialization that's being hoisted on our schools, a sexualization that's being hoisted on our schools. And people are saying, wait a minute, true wisdom comes when I am educated within a moral framework that actually is correct. And the Judeo-Christian one has serviced this country so well for so long. And like you said, let's at least get back to making sure they can think properly. And then we'll get into the philosophies that we're talking about. So go ahead, yeah, the ABC is not the CRT.",
